# Byte-exact storage. This repository pins evidence by SHA-256 (the manifest's `_registry` block, the
# acceptance digests asserted in `tests/`, `release/onboarding-kit/KIT_MANIFEST.txt`), so a checked-out
# file has to be the same bytes the digest was taken over. Without this line git's EOL conversion
# rewrites LF to CRLF on Windows checkouts, which makes the stored blob differ from the working tree
# while `git status` still reports clean.
* -text
